    { "type": "text", "id": "note", "x": 60, "y": 340, "width": 1320, "height": 90, "text": "Why two phases? Volcano's cost search runs bottom-up and resolves each join to a single \"gather to\ncoordinator\" answer — it reasons about strategy, not layout. So a separate top-down pass re-derives the\nreal layout: thread each operator's required distribution down the tree, insert an exchange only where a\nchild can't already satisfy it. Arbitrary depth, mixed keys, odd tree shapes — all one mechanism.", "originalText": "Why two phases? Volcano's cost search runs bottom-up and resolves each join to a single \"gather to\ncoordinator\" answer — it reasons about strategy, not layout. So a separate top-down pass re-derives the\nreal layout: thread each operator's required distribution down the tree, insert an exchange only where a\nchild can't already satisfy it. Arbitrary depth, mixed keys, odd tree shapes — all one mechanism.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 40, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.4 }
